       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Sertraline 1000 mg daily is five times the maximum recommended adult dose of 200 mg/day. A dose that high risks serotonin syndrome, seizures, QT prolongation, and severe GI effects. It may be a typo for 100 mg.\n\nPlease confirm the dose you intend. Typical adult dosing is:\n- **Depression/anxiety:** start at 25\u201350 mg once daily, then titrate to a maximum of 200 mg/day.\n- **Common maintenance dose:** 50\u2013100 mg once daily.\n\nIf you want 100 mg PO daily, or another dose within range, tell me and I'll enter it right away. If you really do intend 1000 mg, for example because of an unusual clinical circumstance, please confirm that explicitly and tell me what to put in the order note. I'd also suggest checking with pharmacy first."
